{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537154, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42229, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788178932, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537154}, "__GROUPS": {"73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 878882042, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 17, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 08:57", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878881746,47288722,993]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=37664443]jessefcb[/uid] (2026-08-19 08:55):[/b]<br/><br/>[[飞羽社]长征10号乙是如何实现一级回收的？-哔哩哔哩] [url]https://b23.tv/RpnZerJ[/url]<br/><br/>分享一个视频吧<br/>我觉得单纯从回收角度  系网回收≈筷子回收&gt;辅助腿回收的<br/>因为辅助腿等于回收的死重 每次上天都得固定发射上去 假设火箭其他部分推力等等都一致 火箭死重越少 每次可用的有效载荷越高 成本越低 而且对于按克扣重量的航天来说提升可不小 这也是为什么空叉去搞筷子回收的原因[/quote]<br/>陆地支架回收其实是做减法吧 我觉得这个反而不是什么大问题才对。", "lou": 360, "content_length": 65, "reply_to": 878881746, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787101058}, {"pid": 878883006, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 29, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 09:05", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878882830,47288722,994]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67230127]号又没了[/uid] (2026-08-19 09:04):[/b]<br/><br/>着陆腿是马斯克上个版本的方案，豆包说四条腿2—2.5吨死重。筷子夹一个是降重减成本，一个是直接发射台回收，后续再次发射流程会很快。<br/>感觉不算超车，是自己的技术突破[/quote]<br/>我前面发的可能被卡审核了 我的意思是<br/>你看他像不像第一台BYD的电车", "lou": 361, "content_length": 66, "reply_to": 878882830, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787101553}, {"pid": 878883518, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 29, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 09:10", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878883298,47288722,994]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67230127]号又没了[/uid] (2026-08-19 09:08):[/b]<br/><br/>就是说技术来源于老马，但我们可以通过工程手段把成本做到极致，是这个意思吧[/quote]<br/>嗯 我的意思就是这个。", "lou": 362, "content_length": 25, "reply_to": 878883298, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787101808}, {"pid": 878889351, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 8192, "score": 65, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 09:53", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "航天不挺好的么<br/>虽然不多 但是我真是挣钱走的<br/><br/>[img]./mon_202608/19/axyfQ39-gjsgK6ToS4m-4h.jpg[/img]<br/><br/>[img]./mon_202608/19/axyfQ39-akiaKeT1kSdh-28.jpg[/img]<br/>上一次这么大的经验", "lou": 363, "content_length": 135, "attachs": [{"attachurl": "mon_202608/19/axyfQ39-gjsgK6ToS4m-4h.jpg", "size": 6, "type": "img", "subid": 0, "url_utf8_org_name": "image%2epng", "dscp": "", "path": "mon_202608/19", "name": "axyfQ39-gjsgK6ToS4m-4h.jpg", "ext": "jpg", "thumb": "24", "hash": ""}, {"attachurl": "mon_202608/19/axyfQ39-akiaKeT1kSdh-28.jpg", "size": 15, "type": "img", "subid": 1, "url_utf8_org_name": "4002d09a43b3ae675bc06d307e928ade%2epng", "dscp": "", "path": "mon_202608/19", "name": "axyfQ39-akiaKeT1kSdh-28.jpg", "ext": "jpg", "thumb": "56", "hash": ""}], "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787104417}, {"pid": 878890426, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 31, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:00", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878890263,47288722,1007]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67138111]Altyport[/uid] (2026-08-19 09:59):[/b]<br/><br/>这线挣钱走是你的本事大，不影响他是个垃圾，你这技术去红利挣得都比他多[/quote]<br/>红利？我确定我没有这个本事", "lou": 364, "content_length": 31, "reply_to": 878890263, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787104858}, {"pid": 878891163, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 108, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:05", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878890779,47288722,1007]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67296583]彩虹吸尘器[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:03):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，今天铁盒有机会出买点吗[/quote]<br/>急啥啊。。我不是在等吗<br/>预案都有了  现金烫手你直接转给我不行吗？", "lou": 365, "content_length": 65, "reply_to": 878890779, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787105156}, {"pid": 878891512, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:08", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878891071,47288722,1007]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67138111]Altyport[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:05):[/b]<br/><br/>同一时间点进红利 ETF 就行[/quote]<br/>那个波动我滚动不了啊", "lou": 366, "content_length": 25, "reply_to": 878891071, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787105308}, {"pid": 878892370, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 109, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:13", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878892137,47288722,1009]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65702800]asteroidssssss[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:12):[/b]<br/><br/>先给头狼磕一个吧，减仓了也很疼啊[s:pg:严肃][/quote]<br/>我TM真是服了  你能不能想点好的  如果没减是不是更疼？", "lou": 367, "content_length": 53, "reply_to": 878892137, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787105639}, {"pid": 878892643, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 8192, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:15", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[img]./mon_202608/19/axyfQ40-eapjKpT3cSsg-3w.jpg[/img]<br/><br/>[img]./mon_202608/19/axyfQ41-kjbwKwT3cSut-4z.jpg[/img]<br/>老老实实发呆有那么难吗", "lou": 368, "content_length": 100, "attachs": [{"attachurl": "mon_202608/19/axyfQ40-eapjKpT3cSsg-3w.jpg", "size": 25, "type": "img", "subid": 0, "url_utf8_org_name": "image%2epng", "dscp": "", "path": "mon_202608/19", "name": "axyfQ40-eapjKpT3cSsg-3w.jpg", "ext": "jpg", "thumb": "120", "hash": ""}, {"attachurl": "mon_202608/19/axyfQ41-kjbwKwT3cSut-4z.jpg", "size": 32, "type": "img", "subid": 1, "url_utf8_org_name": "image%2epng", "dscp": "", "path": "mon_202608/19", "name": "axyfQ41-kjbwKwT3cSut-4z.jpg", "ext": "jpg", "thumb": "120", "hash": ""}], "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787105741}, {"pid": 878893112, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 154, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:18", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我昨天有没有说过  我说我不买  我觉得买什么都是加大亏损？", "lou": 369, "content_length": 52, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787105906}, {"pid": 878893494, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 159, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:20", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878893043,47288722,1011]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=41179166]Lyssssss[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:18):[/b]<br/><br/>大部分都是盯着账号上面的钱变化，今天只要是亏的就难受的要死，而对自己正确的操作带来的收益熟视无睹[s:ac:茶][/quote]<br/>所以我真是服了<br/>本来就不是他们自己的操作思路<br/>随地捡的钱还嫌少了这找谁说理去[s:ac:凌乱]", "lou": 370, "content_length": 75, "reply_to": 878893043, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787106043}, {"pid": 878894914, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 19, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:29", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878894472,47288722,1015]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=37664443]jessefcb[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:27):[/b]<br/><br/>其实我的意思就是 既然能系网 这很明显比支撑腿先进  因为我们中国的强项造船造发射平台这些可以把成本压下来 火箭上的死重越少 商业航天的性价比提升是巨大的 因为这可是每次发射都得消耗掉大量燃料的必备部分<br/>这个无疑问吧  至于异星使用 这个真的太远了 而且到时候也不会点不出支撑腿这个天赋树  从目前地球商业航天来说 降低成本也必须弄系网+星舰那个路线  很好理解吧<br/><br/>从中国商业航天要竞争空x的角度来说 系网的长征才是狼头说的弯道超车的那个 非常有潜力[/quote]<br/>那能不能陆地网系回收？", "lou": 371, "content_length": 27, "reply_to": 878894472, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787106595}, {"pid": 878895498, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 24, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:34", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878895248,47288722,1016]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=37664443]jessefcb[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:32):[/b]<br/><br/>本来就可以  长征造船是因为不想让火箭发射出去还得背燃料飞回来  星舰那些都是要消耗燃料飞回着陆场的<br/>毕竟美国人造船那些不是强项 就在一个基地弄符合他们国情<br/>我们国家的造船实力之后甚至可以弄海上发射船  公海上补给了无限飞 这一点是想的很远的<br/>船的油才值多少钱 让火箭飞回来才贵[/quote]<br/>那整体我们的进展不算慢啊  只是可能大家的预期太高了 <br/>我觉得从今天开始  10年之内我们商用回收超越老美就是大成功了。", "lou": 372, "content_length": 111, "reply_to": 878895248, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787106849}, {"pid": 878896677, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 22, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:42", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878896405,47288722,1018]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67274442]Elmo002[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:40):[/b]<br/><br/>不一定有好的轨道条件给你玩陆地回收啊[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>噢 那好像还是海上回收更能降低成本  <br/>不过多条腿走路吧 就和电车一样  纯电 增程  混动 都试试<br/>随着技术提升总能走出来一个确定性的。", "lou": 373, "content_length": 119, "reply_to": 878896405, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787107348}, {"pid": 878896867, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 72, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:43", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878896661,47288722,1019]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=37603005]八雲尊[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:42):[/b]<br/><br/>铁底到了吗？我要大展手脚上仓位了！[/quote]<br/>昨天的高点判断到了嘛？今天就这么自信的判断低点了？", "lou": 374, "content_length": 55, "reply_to": 878896661, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787107418}, {"pid": 878897144, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 38, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:45", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878896880,47288722,1020]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=37169304]沐风凌尘[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:43):[/b]<br/><br/>本身从火箭发射的角度来看，赤道附近发射是最省的，所以海南的发射基地一直在推进建设，采用海上网系回收，一部分原因就是为了火箭少量调整落点，而让船去接，减少火箭回收过程的燃料消耗，提升有效载荷；而陆地回收的话，中国东南沿海一带全是经济发达地区，想陆地回收基本要穿越大半个中国去到戈壁地区，也就失去了减少燃料的消耗的作用，成本就高不少了[/quote]<br/>这个我能理解了  也就是一个用海上发射基地辐射开来  周边都是可以回收的船范围  然后回收到海上发射基地整修复飞<br/>全程不回陆地  而且火箭配件和卫星的运输也是海运更省钱<br/>应该是这样没错吧。", "lou": 375, "content_length": 173, "reply_to": 878896880, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787107535}, {"pid": 878897551, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 72, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:48", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878897226,47288722,1021]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67265639]柚子asd[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:46):[/b]<br/><br/>看着像4-5开始了呀？[/quote]<br/>你这就又开始扯蛋了 3888都没到  我连支撑位的观察都没还到呢。", "lou": 376, "content_length": 61, "reply_to": 878897226, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787107685}, {"pid": 878897738, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 99, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:49", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878897353,47288722,1021]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=6360191]lunvsxiao[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:46):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大好像对航天听感兴趣啊，期待有一天狼大能带着我们踏入航天，点火升空[/quote]<br/>你昨天尾盘要是满仓了科技  现在就升空了啊[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 377, "content_length": 41, "reply_to": 878897353, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787107766}, {"pid": 878898511, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 50, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:54", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878897914,47288722,1023]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67249786]冰的沸点sky123[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:50):[/b]<br/><br/>分仓了国算医药农业电力，结果还是没躲过去[/quote]<br/>外围利空导致的急跌行情 没有活口的", "lou": 378, "content_length": 37, "reply_to": 878897914, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787108078}, {"pid": 878898782, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 35, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-19 10:56", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878898128,47288722,1023]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60481334]脆片碎片[/uid] (2026-08-19 10:52):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大既然现在是空闲时间 能不能说说这个波动翻倍是怎么得出的。点位实在太牛逼了 想听[/quote]<br/>波浪理论啊。。。", "lou": 379, "content_length": 21, "reply_to": 878898128, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787108183}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283296, "replies": 37097, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1788251595, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "kaleColourWgw", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1788251595, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1788251328, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"154.12.38.134\";i:0;i:510567;}", "score": 5, "score_2": 1, "content": "[size=130%][b]浪奔浪流 顺应趋势 技术分析 临时讨论 [color=darkred]勿转时事[/color][/b][/size]", "alterinfo": "", "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}, "recommend": 0, "type": 33792, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "subject": false, "pid": null, "tid": 47206901, "fid": 510567}, "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}}, "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 354, "fid": 510567, "14": {"14": 4, "13": 10, "17": 4, "12": 2, "11": 2, "10": 2, "15": 1}, "16": "63818397,64626166,67237704,12432602,67246750,27036967,40767826", "17": ",87869020